flowchart LR
  T[Trigger: setState, context change, query result] --> R[Render phase: call component functions, build new element tree]
  R --> D[Reconcile: diff against previous fiber tree by type and key]
  D --> C[Commit phase: apply minimal DOM mutations]
  C --> L[Layout effects then paint]
  L --> E[Passive effects: useEffect runs after paint]
  E -->|setState inside effect| T
